E: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; □ 활동내용</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ­ 근무기간 : 2016. 5. 19.(목) ~ 5. 22.(일) (09:00~18:00)</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ­ 통역안내, 행사운영지원, 홍보</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ­ 교통정리, 행사장 환경정비, 소품정리 등</span></span><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
